        <mxCell id="t2_pfn" value="&lt;b&gt;Function Pod Fleet: image-processor-app (1 to 5 Replicas)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;IPs: 10.244.0.21 - 10.244.0.25 | Port 8080/TCP | In-Memory C-Libwebp Engine (256MB RAM Hard Ceiling)&lt;br&gt;• 32MB tmpfs RAM Disk (/tmp) | UID 1000 Non-Root | OpenTelemetry W3C traceparent Propagation" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dbeafe;strokeColor=#3b82f6;fontSize=9.5;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="t2_nsf"><mxGeometry x="20" y="40" width="680" height="75" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t2_npb" value="&lt;b&gt;ZERO-TRUST NETWORKPOLICY RULES (security_suite/network_policy_and_secrets.yaml):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Ingress Rule:&lt;/b&gt; ALLOW from namespace 'openfaas' (Gateway &amp; Queue-Worker) on Port 8080/TCP ONLY.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Egress Rule 1:&lt;/b&gt; ALLOW to MinIO S3 (default namespace) on Port 9000/TCP ONLY.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Egress Rule 2:&lt;/b&gt; ALLOW to kube-system (CoreDNS) on Port 53/UDP &amp; TCP ONLY.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Default Rule:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font color='#b91c1c'&gt;&lt;b&gt;DEFAULT-DENY ALL OTHER INGRESS &amp; EGRESS (Kernel Silently Drops Outbound SYN Packets)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fee2e2;strokeColor=#ef4444;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=9.5;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="t2_nsf"><mxGeometry x="20" y="125" width="680" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

